{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a wizard apprentice, attend classes to train your magical skills and free the world from the curse that threatens innocent creatures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet other apprentices while exploring the academy and uncover its secrets at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/3eeef296d9dc4ac694adbc4d7ca4a0fd.poster.avif?t=1776966501\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/3eeef296d9dc4ac694adbc4d7ca4a0fd.webm?t=1776966501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/3eeef296d9dc4ac694adbc4d7ca4a0fd.mp4?t=1776966501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRAIN YOUR MAGICAL SKILLS BY ATTENDING CLASSES:</strong> In the botanic class, attend your garden to grow and harvest fresh vegetables. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch and collect spell-creatures in the spell class. Learn other skills such as how to brew powerful potions, craft charms and heal creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/1ff4ecedebe70af110d129c125850323.poster.avif?t=1776966501\" width=658 height=574 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/1ff4ecedebe70af110d129c125850323.webm?t=1776966501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/1ff4ecedebe70af110d129c125850323.mp4?t=1776966501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BEFRIEND OTHER APPRENTICES:</strong> Meet a cast of unique characters and together explore the academy to uncover all its secrets. Be a part of their stories and form great relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/42f29071d82bcc67a14c0eb7d9cba220.avif?t=1776966501\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PERSONALISE YOUR CHARACTER AND YOUR CAT:</strong> You can change the appearance of your character and your spirit companion as well!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy chilling with your spirit companion, form a strong bond with them by giving them loving pats, treats and playing games. Your cat will always be there for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/02b8a24d3a7a202d96bead0b124500c7.avif?t=1776966501\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OUTSIDE THE ACADEMY:</strong> Explore the surroundings of the academy and discover all its secrets or just relax while practising bug catching, fishing, foraging or cooking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/c8a45f8286b8d7df789a0835c3448fc4.avif?t=1776966501\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1340380?t=1776966501","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/b60554b84748945f91fdc689a2b3052b8057191d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1776966501","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/ad8415b2dfa1ae5bc0b284f289e54bd9a52e4f40/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776966501","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/ad8415b2dfa1ae5bc0b284f289e54bd9a52e4f40/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776966501","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a wizard apprentice, attend classes to train your magical skills and free the world from the curse that threatens innocent creatures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet other apprentices while exploring the academy and uncover its secrets at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/3eeef296d9dc4ac694adbc4d7ca4a0fd.poster.avif?t=1776966501\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/3eeef296d9dc4ac694adbc4d7ca4a0fd.webm?t=1776966501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/3eeef296d9dc4ac694adbc4d7ca4a0fd.mp4?t=1776966501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRAIN YOUR MAGICAL SKILLS BY ATTENDING CLASSES:</strong> In the botanic class, attend your garden to grow and harvest fresh vegetables. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch and collect spell-creatures in the spell class. Learn other skills such as how to brew powerful potions, craft charms and heal creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/1ff4ecedebe70af110d129c125850323.poster.avif?t=1776966501\" width=658 height=574 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/1ff4ecedebe70af110d129c125850323.webm?t=1776966501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/1ff4ecedebe70af110d129c125850323.mp4?t=1776966501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BEFRIEND OTHER APPRENTICES:</strong> Meet a cast of unique characters and together explore the academy to uncover all its secrets. Be a part of their stories and form great relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/42f29071d82bcc67a14c0eb7d9cba220.avif?t=1776966501\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PERSONALISE YOUR CHARACTER AND YOUR CAT:</strong> You can change the appearance of your character and your spirit companion as well!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy chilling with your spirit companion, form a strong bond with them by giving them loving pats, treats and playing games. Your cat will always be there for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340380/extras/02b8a24d3a7a202d96bead0b124500c7.avif?t=1776966501\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OUTSIDE THE ACADEMY:</strong> Explore the surroundings of the academy and discover all its secrets or just relax while practising bug catching, fishing, foraging or cooking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragra